# BlueROV2Heavy on ArduSub, loaded after ArduPilot's default_params/sub-6dof.parm.
# BiguaSim model: dynamics.marine.MarinePlant, eight T200 thrusters at -278.9..278.9 rad/s (k_eta w|w|).

# Vectored 6DOF frame: MOT1..4 horizontal as on the BlueROV2, MOT5..8 front-right, front-left, rear-right and
# rear-left vertical. The bridge drives the BiguaSim thrusters with them (signs and order in vehicle.py).
FRAME_CONFIG    2
MOT_PWM_MIN     1100
MOT_PWM_MAX     1900

# One IMU sample per physics step (200 Hz): ArduPilot wants them at 1.8 x its loop rate or more.
SCHED_LOOP_RATE 100

# GUIDED / AUTO speed: BiguaSim's own controller allows 0.29 m/s (MarinePlant._speed_limit, box hull) before a
# thruster saturates.
WP_SPD          0.25
WP_ACC          0.25
